  "all_ingredients_flat": "1/2 cup corn flour (chakki atta), 1/2 cup residue of oat milk, 1 cup mixed vegetables (minced fine), red onion, sponge gourd, grated carrot, amla berries, plantain, raw papaya, other veggies of your choice, a small piece of ginger, 1/2 green chili, a few curry leaves, 1/2 tsp turmeric powder, 1/2 tsp roasted cumin seeds powder, 1/4 tsp carom seeds, 1/4 tsp hing (asafoetada), 1/4 tsp black pepper, 1/4 tsp garlic powder, 1/4 tsp mustard powder, sesame seeds, pumpkin seeds, rolled oats",
